This repository contains the Prompt Engineering assets and AI applications developed for **AI Immanuel's Bakehouse** during **AIQEP Sprint 1 – Prompt Engineering Foundation**.

The project demonstrates how IBM Prompt Engineering concepts were applied to bakery product development, recipe generation, menu planning, marketing, packaging, and operational AI assistants.

